    "Water travels in a circle called the WATER CYCLE — it never stops!",
    "The sun heats water in seas and rivers, and it rises up as vapor — that's EVAPORATION.",
    "High in the sky, the vapor cools and forms clouds — that's CONDENSATION.",
    "When clouds get heavy, water falls as rain — that's PRECIPITATION. Then it starts all over again!"
